;Default language victory quotes (optional).  **MUGEN 1.0**
;If this section is included, the default language victory quotes must be in English.
[Quotes]
; Up to 100 victory quotes can be specified per language (victory0 - victory99)
victory1 = "I have no more attachment to the name Battousai the Manslayer."
victory2 = "New eras don't come about because of swords, they're created by the people who wield them."
victory3 = "I have no desire to take anyone's life, no matter what the reason."
victory4 = "I am myself until the end! I fight as Himura Kenshin!"
victory5 = "Nothing is stronger than the will to live."
victory6 = "The true answer comes not by fighting but by living your life, as you atone for your sins."


